      "n": 1,
      "img": "https://www.africanstorybook.org/illustrations/pages/9441.png",
      "text": "Akai kabo ma lahayn. Carruurta kale ee da'deeda ah way lahaayeen kabo.",
      "sourceUrl": "https://www.africanstorybook.org/newviewer/index.php?bt=3&dual=false&id=52497#page=1",
      "sourceDigest": "sha256:95901729330a9eb44e11880dca6a4f581bb8bc4e6fd539650c43e9aa2ed6f33d"
    },
    {
      "n": 2,
      "img": "https://www.africanstorybook.org/illustrations/pages/9492.png",
      "text": "\"Way adag tahay in la ciyaaro adigoon kabo haysan,\" ayay Akai u sheegtay hooyadeed.",
      "sourceUrl": "https://www.africanstorybook.org/newviewer/index.php?bt=3&dual=false&id=52497#page=2",
      "sourceDigest": "sha256:1dc419aaba4d3e493975fc0c30c267a70bc3274238b99dd0c96bc0579e0f285e"
    },
    {
      "n": 3,
      "img": "https://www.africanstorybook.org/illustrations/pages/9493.png",
      "text": "\"Akai, waxaan u malaynayaa in la joogo waqtigii aad kabo heli lahayd,\" ayay tiri hooyadeed.",
      "sourceUrl": "https://www.africanstorybook.org/newviewer/index.php?bt=3&dual=false&id=52497#page=3",
      "sourceDigest": "sha256:fc2945b2ae64dda2944d5bd5bbf4048a470b933307670e4220ccd3b146c33c27"
    },
    {
      "n": 4,
      "img": "https://www.africanstorybook.org/illustrations/pages/9496.png",
      "text": "Hooyadu waxay toosisay Akai aroortii hore subaxdii xigtay.",
      "sourceUrl": "https://www.africanstorybook.org/newviewer/index.php?bt=3&dual=false&id=52497#page=4",
      "sourceDigest": "sha256:3e5036627a8f0be6c75efb61e211272da4fa206891adddb9152729313df0aa6e"
    },
    {
      "n": 5,
      "img": "https://www.africanstorybook.org/illustrations/pages/9495.png",
      "text": "Akai iyo hooyadeed waxay tageen suuqa.",
      "sourceUrl": "https://www.africanstorybook.org/newviewer/index.php?bt=3&dual=false&id=52497#page=5",
      "sourceDigest": "sha256:ba63ff34d55b9c5fdcf09dd43c74fb777f01300d3932ea45dea2c751e69404f5"
    },
    {
      "n": 6,
      "img": "https://www.africanstorybook.org/illustrations/pages/9497.png",
      "text": "Waxay galeen dukaan kabo. Hooyadeedna waxay u gaday Akai kabo.",
      "sourceUrl": "https://www.africanstorybook.org/newviewer/index.php?bt=3&dual=false&id=52497#page=6",
      "sourceDigest": "sha256:27abe2db02e2e2aa20a61359c481ae86835f85a615a6e349631813d003eed8bd"
    },
    {
      "n": 7,
      "img": "https://www.africanstorybook.org/illustrations/pages/9499.png",
      "text": "Habeenkii, Akai waxay ka fikiraysay kabahaheeda cusub.",
      "sourceUrl": "https://www.africanstorybook.org/newviewer/index.php?bt=3&dual=false&id=52497#page=7",
      "sourceDigest": "sha256:f6fe1a308f583aad2df0b676829f5954f3301295e7c15af6df2fe8a3aeb3fee1"
    },
    {
      "n": 8,
      "img": "https://www.africanstorybook.org/illustrations/pages/10444.png",
      "text": "Akai waxay xiratay kabahaheeda cusub.",
      "sourceUrl": "https://www.africanstorybook.org/newviewer/index.php?bt=3&dual=false&id=52497#page=8",
      "sourceDigest": "sha256:360464c50cbb793f2e1fe29dd7aad2fb6525c95984c22bb0d1ec33a78224a357"
    },
    {
      "n": 9,
      "img": "https://www.africanstorybook.org/illustrations/pages/9498.png",
      "text": "Akai waxay ka fikiraysay sida ay u tusi lahayd kabahaheeda.",
      "sourceUrl": "https://www.africanstorybook.org/newviewer/index.php?bt=3&dual=false&id=52497#page=9",
      "sourceDigest": "sha256:c7a221f1681f789802aad1c649fd4ea21a08efc4afd13d63edb4a4b485feb477"
    },
    {
      "n": 10,
      "img": "https://www.africanstorybook.org/illustrations/pages/9502.png",
      "text": "Akai waxay xiratay kabahaheeda cusub mar labaad, iyadoo qoob ka ciyaaraysa qolkeeda.",
      "sourceUrl": "https://www.africanstorybook.org/newviewer/index.php?bt=3&dual=false&id=52497#page=10",
      "sourceDigest": "sha256:68e678feaf80a13071e4ce47377ea36c81ad13df3f16f2485fdc88c5bf382aff"
    },
    {
      "n": 11,
      "img": "https://www.africanstorybook.org/illustrations/pages/9501.png",
      "text": "\"Akai, sariirta laguma xirto kabo,\" ayay tiri hooyadeed.",
      "sourceUrl": "https://www.africanstorybook.org/newviewer/index.php?bt=3&dual=false&id=52497#page=11",
      "sourceDigest": "sha256:ff91c5fe7ef0bec1bb87a4095b2d0f4b8c1a3badad2d525ffc637b818f4390e4"
    },
    {
